cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Please cite the associated Future Transportation article and this reproducibility package.
title: "From Geometric Endpoint Micro-Modes to Semantic Maneuver Graphs: Homography-Guided Vehicle Trajectory Clustering at Complex Urban Intersections"
type: software
authors:
  - name: PathFindRNET research team
version: futuretransp-hg-smg-tc-v1.0
date-released: 2026-08-08
repository-code: https://github.com/aronagg/PathFindRNET_2.0
url: https://aronagg.github.io/PathFindRNET_2.0/publications/hg-smg-tc/
license: NOASSERTION
keywords:
  - vehicle trajectory clustering
  - homography
  - semantic maneuver graph
  - traffic video analytics
  - intelligent transportation systems
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Publication-specific protocols, code, tests, compact metrics, figures, and manuscript
  support materials for the revised Future Transportation manuscript introducing
  HG-SMG-TC, Homography-Guided Semantic Maneuver Graph Trajectory Clustering. The
  package supports leakage-controlled split-aware evaluation on five Bellevue
  intersections and independent evaluation using exhaustive human-defined
  polygon-rule-based reference labels.
